# Build context of the fake-Kidde harness image (`make harness-build`). The Dockerfile COPYs
# only fake_kidde.py. Each class below is excluded at every depth (case-sensitive), so none
# of them can reach the builder.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
**/.envrc
**/*credentials.json
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/.npmrc
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_dsa*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.git
